# Formspree — one form id per site form.
#
# Create four forms in the CLIENT's Formspree account (not KLC's — these submissions carry
# a deceased person's name and location, so the client is the data controller), then copy
# each form's id here. The id is the hash in https://formspree.io/f/<hash>.
#
# The notification recipient is a Formspree dashboard setting, NOT part of the id — moving
# from emanuelschapel@yahoo.com to a business address later needs no code change and no
# redeploy.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values. .env is gitignored.

VITE_FORMSPREE_IMMEDIATE=
VITE_FORMSPREE_CONTACT=
VITE_FORMSPREE_PLANNING=
VITE_FORMSPREE_PRICING=
